no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.admin..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.contest..',\ because\ Admin\ reads\ Contest\ via\ Q/E\ (RPC/outbox),\ not\ direct\ Mapper/Entity.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY\ for\ the\ frozen\ baseline\ and\ burn-down\ list.=6241efbe-28f1-49ee-8591-99819a1789be
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.moderation..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.user..',\ because\ Moderation\ reaches\ users\ via\ Auth\ RPC\ (C)\ or\ event\ (E),\ not\ direct\ User/UserMapper.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY.=4cafac08-dc51-4004-8f57-eacb8dd5c1b2
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.submission..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.queue.service..',\ because\ Submission\ depends\ on\ queue\ ports\ only.\ QueueService\ is\ internal;\ JudgeQueue\ port\ is\ the\ public\ surface.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY.=aa6e157e-c73a-44aa-a3f4-3399c4d70d76
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.submission..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.queue.outbox..',\ because\ Submission\ depends\ on\ queue\ ports\ only.\ Reaching\ queue.outbox\ (JudgeOutboxRecord/Mapper,\ dispatcher,\ reaper)\ is\ internal\ to\ the\ queue\ module.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY.=ab028153-daa2-468f-a6fb-a068dd08f5a8
